# Pass 1 output. Worth ignoring on its own terms, not just as build output:
# every observation carries the OCR text read off the screen at that instant,
# so this is a running transcript of whatever was captured. Credentials in it
# have been through cuts.redact, but that reduces exposure rather than
# guaranteeing it (see cuts/redact.py), and the rest is still your screen.
*.observations.jsonl

